    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG are delighted to present No. 45 Carrigmore Green to the market — a beautifully appointed and generously proportioned three-bedroom duplex in the ever-popular Carrigmore development, Citywest. Extending to approximately 110 sq.m of superbly designed living space, this impressive home is sure to appeal to first-time buyers, those trading up, and investors alike. \n\nBright and inviting throughout, the accommodation has been thoughtfully designed for modern living. The welcoming entrance hall, complete with a guest WC, leads to the heart of the home — a recently renovated open-plan kitchen and dining area boasting stunning views of the Dublin Mountains. This space flows effortlessly into an elegant living room, creating a seamless setting for both everyday comfort and entertaining. A sliding door opens into a sunroom, which in turn leads to a private balcony, offering a tranquil retreat.\n\nUpstairs, there are three spacious double bedrooms, all featuring fitted wardrobes. The principal bedroom benefits from a sleek en-suite shower room, while a beautifully finished contemporary family bathroom completes the accommodation. The property also enjoys the added convenience of two parking permits.\n\nCarrigmore is a well-established and family-friendly development, renowned for its strong sense of community and welcoming atmosphere.\n\nCitywest provides every convenience for modern living, with an excellent selection of schools, shops, cafés, and local services within walking distance. The Citywest Shopping Centre is just moments away. The area is exceptionally well connected, with the Luas Red Line and Dublin Bus services nearby, while the N7, M50, and N81 offer swift access to Dublin City Centre and beyond."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Stylish 3-bed duplex</li><li> 110 sqm (approx.) living accommodation</li><li> Efficient (C) BER rating</li><li> Large green park spaces on your doorstep</li><li> Gas fired central heating</li><li> Double glazed windows</li><li> Parking</li><li> LUAS and Citywest shopping centre within walking distance (5 min walk)</ul>"
      },
